<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Melderskin — Kletta–Melderskin summit return</name><desc>Start at the signed Melderskin parking area at Kletta, follow the road for about 300 metres, then climb the marked path through the Rindane ridges and Skarshaug. Continue over rough stone and the Holo hollow to the protected summit cairn, then return along the same route.

